    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "**rgbSrc**: The source vImage buffer that contains the red, green, and blue channels.",
      "ko": "`ORDER`: 행 기준(C) 또는 열 기준(Fortran) 데이터 배치를 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "464a496310af47391e69ebaf1aef5c2f3b451abb80fd796e9b8979ee723cfa98",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0002",
      "source": "**aSrc**: The source vImage buffer that contains the alpha channel. Set this value to `nil` to specify that the function sets the destination alpha as the constant destination alpha value.",
      "ko": "`UPLO`: 행렬에서 상삼각 또는 하삼각을 사용할지 지정합니다. 유효한 값은 `'U'` 또는 `'L'`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "09198f25f49d8c09ff813878a13cda4845dc382dc7bc39d3378431db3a3e4c59",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0003",
      "source": "**alpha**: The constant destination alpha value. The function ignores this paramater if the `aSrc` parameter isn’t `nil`.",
      "ko": "`TRANSA`: 행렬 A를 사용할지 (`'N'` 또는 `'n'`) 아니면 A의 전치 행렬을 사용할지 (`'T'`, `'t'`, `'C'` 또는 `'c'`) 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "000d257c935522f7247834dd6ba31120af79fb8f6ae817dd10b4d3a1ec76b6ec",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0004",
      "source": "**bgraDest**: A pointer to the destination vImage buffer structure. You’re responsible for filling out the [`height`](vimage_buffer/height.md), [`width`](vimage_buffer/width.md), and [`rowBytes`](vimage_buffer/rowbytes.md) fields of this structure, and for allocating a data buffer of the appropriate size. On return, the data buffer this structure points to contains the destination image data. When you no longer need the data buffer, deallocate the memory to prevent memory leaks.",
      "ko": "`DIAG`: 행렬이 단위 삼각 행렬인지 지정합니다. 가능한 값은 `'U'`(단위 삼각 행렬) 또는 `'N'`(비단위 삼각 행렬)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e667ad4db784e278de95bb7cd66bc5bca8945e5979ddf3bff40b5d06c51ef173",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0005",
      "source": "**premultiply**: A Boolean value that specifes whether the function premultiplies the color channels by the alpha channel.",
      "ko": "`N`: 행렬 `A`의 order입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f716edac329896b939db0ecf1b216ea0a7462a8990a21b11bcb0f9acaf7b3b98",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0006",
      "source": "**flags**: The options to use when performing the operation. If your code implements its own tiling or its own multithreading, pass [`kvImageDoNotTile`](kvimagedonottile.md); otherwise, pass [`kvImageNoFlags`](kvimagenoflags.md).",
      "ko": "`AP`: (압축 저장 형식의) 삼각 행렬 `A`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a9ec25afe5fdb5a63e14b6bf506d17a93be2c971a6e576fbe8988eb27546d65c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0012:0001",
      "source": "If you specify `premultiply` as `true`, the function uses the following calculation to perform the conversion:",
      "ko": "If you specify `premultiply` as `true`, the function uses the following calculation to perform the conversion:",
      "sourceHash": "cd72835b0fa2b908a121394f32e1900354c3952781cc9912e4155d789b72024d",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:parameters:0013:0001",
      "source": "```objc\n r = (a * r)\n g = (a * g)\n b = (a * b)\n```",
      "ko": "```objc\n r = (a * r)\n g = (a * g)\n b = (a * b)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "b4cd6cddbd02d99150d15f798faf648b41c28337cd9e327309c6f35fd07ade83",
      "status": "preserved"
